  "html": "<section class=\"lesson-page\"> <div class=\"course-intro-card\"> <span class=\"exam-badge\"> TASK-BASED SIMULATION </span> <h2> Accounting Changes &amp; Error Corrections </h2> <p> Determine the proper accounting treatment for changes in principle, estimates, reporting entities, and prior-period errors. </p> </div> <div class=\"tbs-data-card\"> <h3> Scenario </h3> <p> For each independent situation below, select the appropriate accounting treatment. </p> </div> <div class=\"tbs-data-card\"> <div class=\"tbs-question\"> <label for=\"tbs3-q1\"> 1. A company revises the estimated useful life of equipment because of new information. </label> <select id=\"tbs3-q1\" class=\"tbs-input\"> <option value=\"\"> Select treatment </option> <option value=\"Retrospective\"> Retrospective </option> <option value=\"Prospective\"> Prospective </option> <option value=\"Error Correction\"> Error Correction </option> </select> </div> <div class=\"tbs-question\"> <label for=\"tbs3-q2\"> 2. A company changes from one acceptable inventory accounting principle to another, and retrospective application is practicable. </label> <select id=\"tbs3-q2\" class=\"tbs-input\"> <option value=\"\"> Select treatment </option> <option value=\"Retrospective\"> Retrospective </option> <option value=\"Prospective\"> Prospective </option> <option value=\"Error Correction\"> Error Correction </option> </select> </div> <div class=\"tbs-question\"> <label for=\"tbs3-q3\"> 3. Management discovers that depreciation expense was incorrectly omitted in the prior year. </label> <select id=\"tbs3-q3\" class=\"tbs-input\"> <option value=\"\"> Select treatment </option> <option value=\"Retrospective\"> Retrospective </option> <option value=\"Prospective\"> Prospective </option> <option value=\"Error Correction\"> Error Correction </option> </select> </div> <div class=\"tbs-question\"> <label for=\"tbs3-q4\"> 4. The reporting entity changes because financial statements now include an entity that was previously presented separately. </label> <select id=\"tbs3-q4\" class=\"tbs-input\"> <option value=\"\"> Select treatment </option> <option value=\"Retrospective\"> Retrospective </option> <option value=\"Prospective\"> Prospective </option> <option value=\"Error Correction\"> Error Correction </option> </select> </div> </div> <div id=\"tbs3-result\"></div> </section>",
  "explanation": "<div class=\"tbs-results\"> <div class=\"key-points\"> <h3> Correct Answers </h3> <p> 1. Change in estimate: <strong>Prospective</strong> </p> <p> 2. Change in accounting principle: <strong>Retrospective</strong> </p> <p> 3. Prior-year omitted depreciation: <strong>Error Correction</strong> </p> <p> 4. Change in reporting entity: <strong>Retrospective</strong> </p> </div> <div class=\"example-box\"> <h3> Why? </h3> <p> Changes in accounting estimates are generally handled prospectively. </p> <p> Changes in accounting principles are generally applied retrospectively when required and practicable. </p> <p> Prior-period mistakes are corrected as errors, not treated as new estimates. </p> <p> Changes in reporting entity are generally reflected retrospectively for periods presented. </p> </div> </div>",
